nts  that go on between the girls are  legitimate whereas the  between the moms is more uncertain I'm  over it  something's got to change after the  fight Jill and Kendall left the studio  and threatened to leave Dance Moms but  the next day Kendall and her mother came  back to the studio with a different  mindset  the mothers talked about how their  actions were inspiring their daughters  to lash out in anger and they went on to  say that they should never fight in  front of the girls  Ashley chose to be the bigger person and  apologized to Jill but their feud was  far from over  Kendall and Brent's tears might have  been real but according to the girls  their mothers fights weren't always  sincere since Dance Moms has a  reputation for being scripted it's not  surprising to find out that the fights  between the moms are hyped up from time  to time during an interview with IBT  Brynn opened up about the drama being  short-lived she said that the fights  don't last forever and that they're just  for filming purposes she also stated  that once the scenes are wrapped up all  the moms are friends again and everyone  goes out for lunch but you know what  we're in Vegas let's celebrate it's  clear that the show's producers aimed to  create a rivalry between Kendall and  Brynn with Chloe gone and Maddie leaving  Dance Moms was losing its dramatic edge  so a new one was created in season six  and seven Jill was put on blast for  bullying Brent  however the dance mom was quick to state  that we shouldn't judge someone based  off of their TV personality according to  her her bullying was blown out of  proportion still there are times when  Jill and Ashley's actions were out of  control although some fights are  scripted the mothers did nothing to  prevent Kendall and Brynn's rivalry but  the Dance Moms weren't the only ones to  make a bad situation worse after all  Abby Lee did choose to pin Kendall and  Brynn against each other at the  beginning of season seven Abby pointed  out the fact that a rivalry could push  the girls to be the best she commented  on how playing nice never got anyone  anywhere so Abby pushed the girls to  fight for their spots on the team  claiming that someone would get cut this  brought the drama to a whole new level  and before we knew it Ashley and Jill  were at each other's throats all over  again  Ashley made it clear that she thought  Brynn was the next Maddie and this  statement drove Jill absolutely crazy  according to Jill kendall was being  groomed  to be the next star and brynn was at the  bottom of the ladder but since Bren was  a marvelous dancer  Jill was clearly just threatened by her  so she constantly picked on brim in  season 6 episode 18 jill threw a fit  when Brynn was standing in front of  Kendall during rehearsal Jill even went  as far as to say that Brynn didn't have  her brain in her head  Jill scolded bread in front of everyone  and when she tried to explain herself  Jill told her not to talk back to adults  honey don't talk back to a grown-up just  say okay I'll stay out of her way well  turns out that Kendall could have used  this advice as well after all she did  more than talk back to Ashley she  straight-up yelled in her face although  it appeared that Brennan Kendall wanted  nothing to do with each other this was  far from the truth  as a matter of fact the girls were  actually friends Kendall shared some  snapchat videos of her and Brynn hanging  out back in 2016 and the girls were  clearly having a great time during an  interview with IBT Kendall said that all  the drama went in one ear and out the  other  she also confirmed that the cast didn't  let the drama get to them because it was  just a TV show despite all the drama  Kendall and Bren have been seen hanging  outs as they both left Dance Moms in  2017 and - believe it or not but Ashlee  and Jill are far from being the enemies  that show portrays them to be before you  go let us know who you think had the  best Dance Moms rivalry Chloe and Maddie  are Kendall and Brennan and that's a  wrap don't forget to hit that subscribe  button to give this video a big thumbs  up thanks for watching the things we'll  see you next time

